OL,3,GNEWSAEco campaign asks pupils to find
OL,4,Aold electronics
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn environmental campaign is calling
OL,7,Ffor primary school pupils to search out
OL,8,Fold electrical appliances to be reused
OL,9,For recycled.
OL,11,FWastebuster, based in Albury in Surrey,
OL,12,Fis in the second year of its Hidden
OL,13,FTreasure Hunt, supplying schools with
OL,14,Ffree teaching resources.
OL,16,FThe campaign aims to educate pupils
OL,17,Fabout the value of the often rare
OL,18,Fmaterials inside electronic devices and
OL,19,Fencourage them to be repaired, passed
OL,20,Fon or recycled.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
